      div(class="voice-inner")
        div(class="section-tag reveal")
          | CUSTOMER VOICE
        h2(class="reveal reveal-delay-1")
          | 土地売買をご相談いただいたお客様の声
        div(class="voice-grid")
          div(class="voice-card reveal reveal-delay-1")
            div(class="voice-stars")
              span
